Error [E0202]: A range write window can't fill a list parameter that may resize
  --> range_write_window_list_param.jet:11:17
    |
 11 |     grow_twice(&values[1..2])
    |                 ^^^^^^
 Why: A range window has a fixed length, but this function may grow or shrink the list it receives through the write-access marker `&`
 Fix: Pass the whole list with the write-access marker `&`: `fill(&values)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0202
